  m_Name: Carta_ArborizacaoUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Arboriza\xE7\xE3o Urbana"
  _titleEn: Urban Tree Planting
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "\xC1rvores sombreiam ruas, reduzem as ilhas de calor e filtram parte
    da polui\xE7\xE3o do ar. Uma rua arborizada pode ficar v\xE1rios graus mais fresca
    que uma rua sem sombra."
  _summaryEn: Trees shade streets, reduce heat islands and filter part of the air
    pollution. A tree-lined street can be several degrees cooler than one without
    shade.
  _realWorld: "Estudos reunidos sobre florestas urbanas estimam que cada 1% a mais
    de cobertura de copas reduz a temperatura do ar entre 0,04 \xB0C e 0,2 \xB0C."
  _realWorldEn: "Studies on urban forests estimate that each extra 1% of tree canopy
    cover lowers air temperature by 0.04 \xB0C to 0.2 \xB0C."
  _tradeOffs: "\xC1rvores levam anos para crescer, pedem poda e manuten\xE7\xE3o,
    e a esp\xE9cie errada quebra cal\xE7adas e fios."
  _tradeOffsEn: Trees take years to grow, need pruning and care, and the wrong species
    breaks sidewalks and power lines.
  _sources:
  - Label: Urban forest (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urban_forest
  - Label: Urban heat island (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urban_heat_island
